the target language is: prolog.

the templates are:
    the calculation date is *a date*; scenario element.
    the treatment and rehabilitation program participation exemption of *a person* applies.
    *a person* is person otherwise required to comply with paragraph 1 requirements; scenario element.
    *a person* is regular participant in drug addiction or alcoholic treatment and rehabilitation program; scenario element.

the knowledge base us_statutes_7_2015_d_2_d includes:


% 7 U.S.C. 2015(d)(2)(D) — us:statutes/7/2015/d/2/D
the text of "7 U.S.C. 2015(d)(2)(D)" is at "sources/us/statutes/7/2015/d/2/D.yaml".

rule treatment_and_rehabilitation_program_participation_exemption_applies with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2015(d)(2)(D)":
the treatment and rehabilitation program participation exemption of a person applies if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2008-10-01 <= D
    and the person is person otherwise required to comply with paragraph 1 requirements
        and the person is regular participant in drug addiction or alcoholic treatment and rehabilitation program.

scenario regular_participant_in_treatment_and_rehabilitation_program_exemption_applies is, as stated in "sources/us/statutes/7/2015/d/2/D.test.yaml" at case 1:
    person_1 is a person.
    the calculation date is 2026-01-01.
    person_1 is regular participant in drug addiction or alcoholic treatment and rehabilitation program.
    person_1 is person otherwise required to comply with paragraph 1 requirements.
    q_treatment_and_rehabilitation_program_participation_exemption_applies expects answers ["the treatment and rehabilitation program participation exemption of person_1 applies"].

scenario not_regular_participant_in_treatment_and_rehabilitation_program_no_exemption is, as stated in "sources/us/statutes/7/2015/d/2/D.test.yaml" at case 2:
    person_1 is a person.
    the calculation date is 2026-01-01.
    person_1 is person otherwise required to comply with paragraph 1 requirements.
    q_treatment_and_rehabilitation_program_participation_exemption_applies expects answers [].

scenario person_not_otherwise_required_has_no_exemption_under_this_branch is, as stated in "sources/us/statutes/7/2015/d/2/D.test.yaml" at case 3:
    person_1 is a person.
    the calculation date is 2026-01-01.
    person_1 is regular participant in drug addiction or alcoholic treatment and rehabilitation program.
    q_treatment_and_rehabilitation_program_participation_exemption_applies expects answers [].

query q_treatment_and_rehabilitation_program_participation_exemption_applies is:
    the treatment and rehabilitation program participation exemption of which person applies.

